<header><p class="enc-kicker">Place · region</p><h1 class="enc-title">Deccan Plateau</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/deccan">Deccan</a> Plateau is the elevated tableland covering much of central and southern <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/india">India</a>. Its rugged, fortified uplands and semi-arid agriculture formed the geographic setting in which the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/maratha-empire">Maratha Empire</a> emerged, providing defensible strongholds and a base for the Maratha economy and expansion.</p></div>
